      "value": "Actually there is 5 Types of world, Public ; That work as intended anyone can join etc, Friends+ that is invisible in the public instances but anyones friends can join, then there is Friends that only allows the room owners Friends to join, there is Invite+ that let's everyone in the room invite anyone from their friends list, then finally Invite Only world that let only the owner invite their friends, and all of this is already in the game and working fine.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
