      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c24e631a97e63496176fba9|full_name}: This is actually incorrect, the OP's observation of the 'new' invite+ behavior is accurate. Invite+ currently only allows the instance owner of a world to create new invites, and allows other users in the world only to accept invites coming in. This behavior is different from the original format of invite+, where all users could invite friends or accept incoming invites, differently than friends+ which simply allows joining at-will.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
